<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia February producer prices up 5.4 pct yr/yr.</title>
<headline>Slovenia February producer prices up 5.4 pct yr/yr.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-03-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Statistical Office of Slovenia reported the following economic indicator details on Wednesday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES     Feb    Jan   Feb96</p>
<p>    monthly change (percent)     0.7    0.3   1.1</p>
<p>    yr/yr change (percent)	 5.4    5.8   7.8</p>
<p>-- Marja Novak, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
